// #  Target 1 of the Lantern adversarial demo: the transparent baseline.    #
// #  Guardian identifiers are written to public state verbatim -- which is  #
// #  what every deployed EVM social-recovery wallet does, because the EVM   #
// #  has no other option. `npm run attack` names every guardian, and every  #
// #  individual vote, without evaluating a single hash.                    #
// #                                                                        #
// #  It is compiled so it can be attacked. It is NOT deployed anywhere.     #
